stockbar (1.0.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Scroll only pinned stocks, so unpinning or removing a stock takes it off
    the top bar. Unpinned stocks stay in the dropdown.
  * Keep both scroll areas at full width, repeating the stocks when there are
    only a few.
  * Keep changes made in another editor or the CLI when the editor saves.

 -- Quark On Rails <quarkXZ@proton.me>  Sat, 31 Oct 2026 00:05:31 +0100

stockbar (1.0.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fit stock labels to available panel space while keeping the clock centered.
    Show an overflow indicator for stocks that do not fit.
  * Add configurable scrolling for the whole watchlist, with speeds 1-10 and
    pause while the dropdown is open. Keep pinned stocks when scrolling is off.
  * Add scroll controls to the CLI and interactive editor.
  * Remind users to log out and back in after extension code or style updates.
    CLI-only and background-service updates do not trigger the notice.

 -- Quark On Rails <quarkXZ@proton.me>  Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:20:46 +0100

